WEBVTT

50:00.941 --> 50:03.277
- I didn't see.
- Liar!

50:03.402 --> 50:04.861
- Liar, liar, liar!
- Arya!

50:04.987 --> 50:07.239
- Hey, stop it! That's enough of that.
- Liar, liar, liar!

50:07.364 --> 50:10.826
- Stop! Arya!
- She's as wild as that animal of hers.

50:10.951 --> 50:12.953
- I want her punished.
- What would you have me do,

50:13.078 --> 50:14.496
whip her through the streets?

50:14.621 --> 50:17.666
Damn it, children fight. It's over.

50:17.791 --> 50:20.419
Joffrey will bear these scars
for the rest of his life.

50:22.045 --> 50:25.507
You let that little girl disarm you?
